      "description": "128 electrode EEG and 8 bipolar EMG or HD-EMG will be noninvasively recorded from electrodes placed in a montage over the scalp and arm muscles while the participant is resting or performing tasks designed to engage specific cortical networks of interest (cognitive, behavioural, motor and sensory)",
      "id": 1,
