    "registry_text": "Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Cutaneous lesions clinically compatible with leishmaniasis and diagnosis confirmed according to the study's composite reference standard.\n* Evaluation at the Leishmaniasis Outpatient Clinic of the University Hospital of Brasilia.\n* Written informed consent from adults or a legally authorized representative's permission and age-appropriate assent for minors, as applicable.\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* An alternative diagnosis established during diagnostic assessment.\n* No confirmed cutaneous leishmaniasis diagnosis.\n\nAdditional exclusions, if any, must be verified against the approved study protocol before release.",
