      "description": "Serial B-mode and color Doppler skin ultrasonography performed with the Clarius L20 (8-20 MHz) at days 0, 15, 30, 45, and 90 after initiation of clinically indicated treatment. This imaging procedure is for observation and does not determine drug allocation.",
      "id": 1,
      "name": "Serial High-Frequency Cutaneous Ultrasonography",
